Hi ,
   I am Amin Momin, a graduate student doing my MS in Bioinformatics at
Georgia Institute of Technology, Atlanta. I would like to volunteer for
the Bioconductor project. My thesis is in the area of modeling of
sphingolipid signaling pathway using gene expression and proteomics
data. 

   I would be pleased to volunteer in writing code and testing.

   Thank you,
   Amin Momin


